---RAM* program---
PC=10
 2: +000 PUPOSE: Add two integers.                                            
 3: +000 INPUT:  two integers.                                                
 4: +000 OUTPUT: sum of the two integers.                                     
 5: +000 -                                                                    
 6: +000 -                                                                    
 7: +000 -                                                                    
 8: +000 -                                                                    
 9: +000 -                                                                    
10: +030 (30)<-input      |  A=input                                          
11: +031 (31)<-input      |  B=input                                          
12: +230 ACC<-(30)        |                                                   
13: +431 ACC<-(ACC)+(31)  |  C=A+B                                            
14: +332 (32)<-(ACC)      |                                                   
15: +132 output (32)      |  output C                                         
16: +910 PC<-10 and quit  |  quit                                             
17: +000 -                                                                    
18: +000 -                                                                    
19: +000 -                                                                    
20: +000 (See also  MULT.RAM)                                                 
